    m_Localized: Link Account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994091118602
    m_Localized: 'Linking an account lets you sign in with the same nickname on other
      devices.

      Linking cannot be undone, and if you forget your password your
      account cannot be recovered.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994091118603
    m_Localized: Username (3-20 chars, letters and numbers)
