  - m_Id: 10788103327779
    m_Localized: 'This will link the ID ''{0}''.

      Linking is permanent - the
      ID can''t be changed afterwards.

      If you forget the password, the account
      can''t be recovered.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6276845892712267879
  - m_Id: 10788103327780
    m_Localized: 'This device will be detached from the account and start over as
      a new anonymous account.

      The account (''{0}'') and its ID stay on the
      server, so you can sign in again.

      The nickname on this device will be
      reset.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6276845892712267879
